# Preserve the supplied upstream licence bytes.
#
# The Space Grotesk OFL text ships with CRLF line terminators, exactly as
# upstream published it. Without this rule git may normalise it to LF on
# checkout depending on the platform's autocrlf setting, and the file that
# ships would no longer be byte-identical to the licence it claims to
# reproduce. A licence that has been silently rewritten is not the licence.
assets/fonts/SpaceGrotesk-OFL.txt -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
assets/icons/licenses/Tabler-Icons-LICENSE.txt -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
assets/icons/licenses/Tabler-Flags-LICENSE.txt -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol

# Binaries are binaries. Never let a line-ending or filter rule touch them.
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
